# fifo_barrier_blocked_wakes_at_timeout: A barrier on stamp slot 5, which no FIFO signals, blocks the root FIFO before the command is consumed: its stamp and 0x100c stay put, with no fault. The guest then stores 1 in slot 5 itself. Nothing signals, but the wait wakes every 2 s on its own, finds the slot reached ("Woke up from timeout"), and the command and the NOP after it run.
